## 9. Final Thought

Today we understood that **prompting is like programming AI with natural language.**

The better we write our prompts → the smarter and more reliable our AI becomes.

| What We Give AI | What AI Becomes |
|---|---|
| No prompt / vague prompt | Unpredictable and generic |
| System prompt | Focused and role-aware |
